# to match the new tag, alongside renaming [Unreleased] → [X.Y.Z]
# in CHANGELOG.md.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use zfs-live in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "zfs-live: a ZFS SMAPIv3 storage driver for XAPI"
authors:
  - family-names: Wolffhechel
    given-names: Jakob
    email: jakob@wolffhechel.dk
type: software
license: LicenseRef-Moksha-Source-Available
repository-code: "https://git.bulkhead.dk/storage/zfs-live"
url: "https://git.bulkhead.dk/storage/zfs-live"
abstract: >-
  zfs-live is a SMAPIv3 storage driver for XAPI-compatible
  hypervisors that exposes native ZFS features (compression,
  copies, snapshots, clones, send/receive, scrub) through XAPI's
  Volume API v5. Each VDI is a ZFS zvol; the driver symlinks into
  the native xapi-storage-script daemon for SM registration and
  dispatch, with an xe CLI wrapper for native ZFS send/receive
  on VDI copy operations.
keywords:
  - XAPI
  - ZFS
  - SMAPIv3
  - storage
  - virtualization
  - Xen
  - block storage
  - snapshots
  - changed block tracking

version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-05-11"

